      "widgets_values": [
        "LoRA test grid\n\nOne picture per LoRA, with an image per weight.\n\n1. LoRA Grid Plan: Add LoRA / Add weight, the ticks switch rows on and off without deleting them. Every ticked LoRA runs at every ticked weight.\n2. Write the prompt, the seed is fixed so the images only differ by the LoRA and its weight.\n3. The weight is drawn on each image, the LoRA's name on its tiled picture. Columns of LoRA Grid sets the images per row (0 = all weights in one row)."
      ],
      "title": "LoRA test grid"
